{
  "id": "433001",
  "resourceId": 330,
  "name": "皇冠",
  "skin": "預設",
  "spineVersion": "4.0",
  "skel": "c330_00.skel",
  "atlas": "c330_00.atlas",
  "defaultAnimation": "idle",
  "interactions": [
    {
      "id": "voice_01",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_01.mp3",
      "text": "身為國王就應該傾聽子民的請求。\n有什麼要拜託我的嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_02.mp3",
      "text": "這身衣裳是用子民的期望所織成的。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_03.mp3",
      "text": "如何？\n這是鐘鳴幫我做的新衣服。很好看吧？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_04.mp3",
      "text": "鐘鳴是皇冠王國的秘書。\n當然要時刻跟在國王身邊。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_05.mp3",
      "text": "看不清楚我的衣裳嗎？\n那不過是你如此認為罷了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_06.mp3",
      "text": "國王在百姓面前\n時時刻刻都要維持格子。\n啊，格調嗎？我通、通常也會這麼說。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_07.mp3",
      "text": "龍捲風嗎？那是我的馬。\n你還想知道什麼？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_08.mp3",
      "text": "鐘鳴說我因此成為了真正的國王。\n你也這麼覺得嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_09.mp3",
      "text": "既然百姓有所期望，\n國王理應隨時準備好換上新裝。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_10.mp3",
      "text": "在找你的國王嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_11.mp3",
      "text": "我的衣裳太過耀眼了嗎？\n那是因為你的內心充滿了光。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_12.mp3",
      "text": "真希望哪天能為您縫製一套\n符合皇冠王國謀士身分的衣服。\n當、當然那會是鐘鳴做的。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_13.mp3",
      "text": "你如果有什麼心願儘管告訴我。\n我一定會幫你實現的。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_14.mp3",
      "text": "你的信任與希望，\n讓我成為了真正的國王。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_15.mp3",
      "text": "不管您在哪、穿什麼樣的衣服，\n都別忘了您是皇冠王國的百姓。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_16.mp3",
      "text": "你已經是皇冠王國的子民了。\n無論如何，千萬別忘記這一點。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_17.mp3",
      "text": "我雖空虛，但卻不寂寞。\n因為皇冠王國的一切使我熠熠生輝。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_18.mp3",
      "text": "嗯……鐘鳴的手藝真是出色。\n您不覺得不管怎麼看，\n都能感受到國王的格調嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_19.mp3",
      "text": "丟下國王就消失得無影無蹤，看來你很忙亂啊。\n忙亂……迷亂……忙盧？總、總之……我會等你的。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_20.mp3",
      "text": "沒關係，我等你。\n先去做你想做的事後再來吧。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_21.mp3",
      "text": "您就放心去忙吧。\n我會在這裡好好欣賞\n鐘鳴幫我做的衣服。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_22.mp3",
      "text": "畢竟等待忙碌的子民是國王的職責。\n呵呵呵……！咳咳，咳咳，咳，咳咳。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_23.mp3",
      "text": "別擔心。\n我的光芒會照亮你的空缺。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_24.mp3",
      "text": "不用擔心。\n我會在這裡找找適合鐘鳴和您的衣服。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_25.mp3",
      "text": "這裡真是美不勝收。\n好想把這裡當作皇冠王國的第二王宮。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_26.mp3",
      "text": "你做得很好。\n皇冠王國的第二王宮在你的帶領下欣欣向榮。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_27.mp3",
      "text": "您把皇冠王國的第二王宮維護得很好，我很高興。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_28.mp3",
      "text": "這裡就是七哨基地。是你的王國嗎？\n啊……前哨基地啊。開、開個玩笑而已。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_29.mp3",
      "text": "無論是地上，還是地下；\n子民在哪，我就在哪。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_30.mp3",
      "text": "這裡依然是明亮又幸福的地方。\n果然稱得上是皇冠王國的謀士所帶領之處。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_31.mp3",
      "text": "這裡的人看起來都很開心。\n……都是多虧了你的努力吧。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_32.mp3",
      "text": "煎哨基地果真是個好地方。\n啊！對、對啦。是前、前哨基地才對。當然啦。我瞭若指掌。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_33.mp3",
      "text": "既然是來看這裡的名物，就有勞您……\n啊，名勝嗎？也、也帶我去參觀那個吧！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_34",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_34.mp3",
      "text": "我是皇冠王國的國王——皇冠。\n你是為了成為皇冠王國的子民才來找我的吧。歡迎你。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_35.mp3",
      "text": "現在，身披子民的光輝，\n我將作為真正的國王，守護皇冠王國。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_36.mp3",
      "text": "我將以全新的服裝、全新的決心，\n再次成為您的國王。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_37",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_37.mp3",
      "text": "就像青春期的孩子一樣，力氣也隨之變大了。\n啊……我是說成長期，我、當然知道啊。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_38.mp3",
      "text": "這就是……你的信任。\n我會好好珍惜的。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_39",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_39.mp3",
      "text": "您的努力絕對不會白費。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_40",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_40.mp3",
      "text": "只要子民需要，我會變得更強大。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_41",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_41.mp3",
      "text": "你的努力讓我的衣裳變得更加耀眼。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_42",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_42.mp3",
      "text": "我會以出色的統籌回報您。\n……統治嗎？我、我知道啦。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_43",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_43.mp3",
      "text": "皇冠王國因此變得更強大。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_44",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_44.mp3",
      "text": "子民的信任是我前進的動力。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_45",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_45.mp3",
      "text": "國王得到多少信任，就會變得多強大。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_46",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_46.mp3",
      "text": "是獻給我的工品。啊，是貢品啊？\n原、原來如此。謝謝你。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_47",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_47.mp3",
      "text": "又要送我禮物啊。\n我說過你只要欣然接受就好。因為我是你的國王。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_48",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_48.mp3",
      "text": "您的禮物和鐘鳴送的一樣。\n總是令我滿意。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_49",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_49.mp3",
      "text": "子民送的禮物當然不能拒絕。謝謝。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_50",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_50.mp3",
      "text": "你的心腸如同這件衣裳般閃耀動人。\n謝謝你的好意。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_51",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_51.mp3",
      "text": "真的很感謝……但這要用在哪裡呢？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_52",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_52.mp3",
      "text": "這就是禮物啊。\n……不過為什麼要送我呢？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_53",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_53.mp3",
      "text": "你的奉獻精神將會成為皇冠王國的寶貴財富。\n我一定會證明給你看。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_54",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_54.mp3",
      "text": "這份禮物很搭這身衣服。\n鐘鳴一定會很開心。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_55",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_55.mp3",
      "text": "一看到你，我的心臟就會撲通撲通地跳……\n這就是胃痛的感覺嗎？",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_56",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_56.mp3",
      "text": "真奇怪，最近總是想到你。\n難道是我的腦袋出問題了嗎？",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_57",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_57.mp3",
      "text": "您就像我身上這件衣服一樣，\n既珍貴又尊貴。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_58",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_58.mp3",
      "text": "照理說，國王應當平等對待每個子民……\n但我感覺你很特別。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_59",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_59.mp3",
      "text": "希望你也能像鐘鳴一樣，一直和我在一起。\n……雖然這是不可能的事。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_60",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_60.mp3",
      "text": "真是傷腦筋。\n我都忍不住想特別寵愛您了呢。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_61",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_61.mp3",
      "text": "你……和鐘鳴一樣，\n對我來說都很重要。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_62",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_62.mp3",
      "text": "現在的我不得不承認，\n你真的很特別……",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_63",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_63.mp3",
      "text": "身為國王，我會成為您最大的助力。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_64",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_64.mp3",
      "text": "子民的請求當然要答應。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_65",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_65.mp3",
      "text": "只要子民需要我，我在所不辭。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_66",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_66.mp3",
      "text": "看來要穿新衣服上場了呢。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_67",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_67.mp3",
      "text": "是你在叫我嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_68",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_68.mp3",
      "text": "你問。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_69",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_69.mp3",
      "text": "您有想要的東西嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_70",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_70.mp3",
      "text": "啊，不是那裡啊。我、我早就知道了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_71",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_71.mp3",
      "text": "隨你心意而動。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_72",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_72.mp3",
      "text": "讓我們抱著全新的心態一同前行吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_73",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_73.mp3",
      "text": "來了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_74",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_74.mp3",
      "text": "危險，快退後。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_75",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_75.mp3",
      "text": "原來是礙事之徒。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_76",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_76.mp3",
      "text": "別擔心。我會守護你的。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_77",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_77.mp3",
      "text": "走吧，是時候展現皇冠王國的威嚴了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_78",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_78.mp3",
      "text": "無論穿著什麼樣的衣服，我都會保護您。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
